id: pm-odw3j8
title: Enforce rendered relationship budgets with expected SDK usage recovery
description: "Sentry PM-CLI-3N and GitHub1513 reproduce impossible context budgets reported as runtime failures plus successful oversized packets. Settle final built-in JSON/TOON bytes including alias counts, actual invocation provenance, read disclosure, lean policy, discovery and token accounting. Refuse an infeasible rendered floor with actionable usage recovery while retaining low-level graph TypeErrors and unrelated cursor/runtime errors."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: bug,cli,observability,sdk
created_at: "2026-10-19T16:07:50.190Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-19T19:02:09.065Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-19T19:02:07.978Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-19T19:02:07.978Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "Preserve failing-before controls for SDK classification, rendered bytes, foreign-workspace scope and empty-reference retry cost. Verify real context retry success across output policies and exact/feasible-only/unavailable evidence; preserve primitive TypeErrors and cursor errors; validate CLI/MCP parity, additive SDK exports, unchanged global coverage and release-aware observability."
parent: pm-f05lsg
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Enforced selected final JSON/TOON ceilings; classify impossible floors as expected usage errors with verified budget evidence, scope-preserving context retries and separate inspection. Bound reference retries, preserve explicit TOON policy, and expose optional typed recovery plus structural validation."
expected_result: Successful context packets fit their rendered ceiling; refusals preserve tracker/query/output policy with verified feasible budgets or explicit uncertainty. CLI/MCP retain recovery and unrelated primitive/runtime errors remain unchanged.
actual_result: "296 linked tests pass; aligned earlier-source controls fail. Native22ed passes all seven runtime jobs and10811 tests at exact global100/100/100/100. CodeRabbit reports no findings, Sentry/telemetry gate passes0 critical/high. The metadata graph correction passes locally; final required closeout checks remain a delivery gate."
